            <ArticleTitle>Operative therapy of coronary arterial aneurysm.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1290-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In summary, a patient with multiple coronary aneurysms and operative therapy is described and 17 previously reported similar cases are reviewed. The proper type of operation for this condition is as yet unclear, but, nevertheless, the reported cases and our case with operative therapy have done well postoperatively despite a variety of procedures performed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
